  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 4515 × 5 − 431 ÷ 3 + 821 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, after ‘+’ and ‘–‘ are interchanged and ‘x’ and ‘÷’ are interchanged:\n\n4515 × 5 − 431 ÷ 3 + 821 = ? ⇒ 4515 ÷ 5 + 431 × 3 – 821 = ?\n\n⇒ __**4515 ÷**____** 5**__ + 431 × 3 – 821 = ?\n\n⇒ 903 + __**431 **____**×**____** 3**__ – 821 = ?\n\n⇒ __**903**____** + 1293**__ – 821 = ?\n\n⇒ __2196____ –____ 821__ = ?\n\n⇒ **1**375 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
